00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:54.660
statements and their potential effect on crude flows. Regional investors appeared to price in higher

00:01:54.660 --> 00:02:00.460
uncertainty around shipping routes and energy costs. Both market participants and officials agree

00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:06.100
tensions remain elevated. They differ on how quickly any supply impact would materialize.

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:10.920
How do equity markets typically price geopolitical risk and energy markets?

